{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an unbelievably boring and simple game I made, but it\u2019s all I can do. Enjoy~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep clicking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warm Narration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each failed attempt is rewarded with a random speech. Don\u2019t hate me for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Secret Thing?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game only asks for one action, but you\u2019ll probably overthink it anyway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endgame</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you\u2019ve played enough, you should stop. Seriously.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why You Should Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You love boring things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Our Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally! This is our first game on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We decided to publish a game after learning a few things about game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re already working on learning more and developing our next game\u2014stay tuned!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517600?t=1742582621","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517600/74827048a35ef1b4086be723c4c89dfd33d160ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742582621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517600/ab5766458ba6866530da27fc989f4e110e32dc55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742582621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517600/ab5766458ba6866530da27fc989f4e110e32dc55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742582621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an unbelievably boring and simple game I made, but it\u2019s all I can do. Enjoy~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep clicking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warm Narration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each failed attempt is rewarded with a random speech. Don\u2019t hate me for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Secret Thing?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game only asks for one action, but you\u2019ll probably overthink it anyway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endgame</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you\u2019ve played enough, you should stop. Seriously.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why You Should Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You love boring things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Our Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally! This is our first game on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We decided to publish a game after learning a few things about game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re already working on learning more and developing our next game\u2014stay tuned!</p>","developers":["/newgame"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517600/3b09e3b84d8b574abb8b1fd368268e5dd4609736/header.jpg?t=1742582621","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109704,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109704/movie480.mp4?t=1742387408","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109704/movie_max.mp4?t=